{"logId": "141bc82e-f376-4958-8cc5-b7531af69323", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "妻的感动", "block_bbox": [238, 227, 454, 282], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 227.0], [454.0, 227.0], [454.0, 282.0], [238.0, 282.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：员工家属/张宁桥", "block_bbox": [277, 293, 453, 315], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[277.0, 293.0], [452.0, 293.0], [452.0, 314.0], [277.0, 314.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "妻钱淑琴，现在胖东来生活广场三楼百货区工作，每当妻说起自己的昨天与今天，都会潸然泪下。", "block_bbox": [239, 372, 1015, 433], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 372.0], [1015.0, 372.0], [1015.0, 433.0], [239.0, 433.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [73, 603, 224, 728], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[73.0, 603.0], [224.0, 603.0], [224.0, 728.0], [73.0, 728.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "妻原来的工作单位由于经营不好，于2000年破产了。接到失业下岗通知的那一刻，妻哭了，毕竟从此要离开自己工作十多年的岗位了。妻说：“我该怎么办？”看着妻黯然神伤的表情，我极力安慰她。很长一段时间里，妻一直无法从下岗的阴影中走出来，一直感觉很茫然，很苦闷。以后在家的日子里，妻一直在努力，希望能重新找到工作，但终因年龄、技能等诸多原因而被拒之门外。妻闷闷不乐的心情，影响了我们已快8岁的女儿，我希望能早日有个转折，打破这种沉重的气氛，重新找回昔日欢乐的家庭。\n2002年7月初，妻经人介绍在胖东来公司填了招工表格。在等待面试的时间里，妻一直在问我：\n“能行吗？”看得出此时妻的心情很忐忑，可以\n看得出此次面试的通过对妻的重要性。\n妻从面试的房间出来，快步跑到我的面前，\n紧紧地抓住我的手，言语中透着无比的喜悦：“你\n知道吗，我被通过了！”泪水随即夺眶而出。", "block_bbox": [238, 442, 1016, 642], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 442.0], [1016.0, 442.0], [1016.0, 642.0], [238.0, 642.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [239, 650, 701, 783], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 650.0], [701.0, 650.0], [701.0, 783.0], [239.0, 783.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [239, 790, 670, 887], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 790.0], [670.0, 790.0], [670.0, 887.0], [239.0, 887.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "以后开始了严格的军训。7月夏天，骄阳似火，看着妻被晒得黝黑的皮肤，看着妻被汗水打湿的发际，我关心地问：“苦吗？累吗？”“不苦，不累！”妻坚定地说，“我坚信军训会培养我严格认真的工作作风和吃苦耐劳的毅力。你知道吗，今天公司领导冒着酷暑来看望我们了，并送来了许多的防暑物品。”", "block_bbox": [238, 895, 675, 1062], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 895.0], [675.0, 895.0], [675.0, 1062.0], [238.0, 1062.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [239, 1069, 811, 1095], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1069.0], [811.0, 1069.0], [811.0, 1095.0], [239.0, 1095.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [680, 641, 1010, 1050], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[680.0, 641.0], [1010.0, 641.0], [1010.0, 1050.0], [680.0, 1050.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "随后的时间里，妻进入了严格的实习阶段：先后经历了电器量贩的搬迁、服饰鞋业大楼的装修、配送中心物品的搬运等工作，始终没有听到妻说一声苦。", "block_bbox": [239, 1105, 1014, 1165], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1105.0], [1014.0, 1105.0], [1014.0, 1165.0], [239.0, 1165.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2002年9月9日，妻被正式分配到胖东来生活广场三楼工作，这天清早，妻穿着崭新的工装，静静地站在镜子前，许久，妻哭了……", "block_bbox": [237, 1173, 1015, 1235], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 1173.0], [1015.0, 1173.0], [1015.0, 1235.0], [237.0, 1235.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer", "block_content": "信任", "block_bbox": [111, 1407, 191, 1449], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [191.0, 1407.0], [191.0, 1449.0], [111.0, 1449.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.5183475017547607, "coordinate": [238, 227, 454, 282], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 227.0], [454.0, 227.0], [454.0, 282.0], [238.0, 282.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7324588298797607, "coordinate": [277, 293, 453, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[277.0, 293.0], [452.0, 293.0], [452.0, 314.0], [277.0, 314.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9058195352554321, "coordinate": [239, 372, 1015, 433], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 372.0], [1015.0, 372.0], [1015.0, 433.0], [239.0, 433.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.4852959215641022, "coordinate": [73, 603, 224, 728], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[73.0, 603.0], [224.0, 603.0], [224.0, 728.0], [73.0, 728.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9562873244285583, "coordinate": [238, 442, 1016, 642], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 442.0], [1016.0, 442.0], [1016.0, 642.0], [238.0, 642.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8918026685714722, "coordinate": [239, 650, 701, 783], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 650.0], [701.0, 650.0], [701.0, 783.0], [239.0, 783.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9190947413444519, "coordinate": [239, 790, 670, 887], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 790.0], [670.0, 790.0], [670.0, 887.0], [239.0, 887.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8959572911262512, "coordinate": [238, 895, 675, 1062], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 895.0], [675.0, 895.0], [675.0, 1062.0], [238.0, 1062.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9362022280693054, "coordinate": [680, 641, 1010, 1050], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[680.0, 641.0], [1010.0, 641.0], [1010.0, 1050.0], [680.0, 1050.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7374582290649414, "coordinate": [239, 1069, 811, 1095], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 1069.0], [811.0, 1069.0], [811.0, 1095.0], [239.0, 1095.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9042825698852539, "coordinate": [239, 1105, 1014, 1165], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 1105.0], [1014.0, 1105.0], [1014.0, 1165.0], [239.0, 1165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8844134211540222, "coordinate": [237, 1173, 1015, 1235], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[237.0, 1173.0], [1015.0, 1173.0], [1015.0, 1235.0], [237.0, 1235.0]]}, {"cls_id": 8, "label": "footer", "score": 0.33922079205513, "coordinate": [111, 1407, 191, 1449], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [191.0, 1407.0], [191.0, 1449.0], [111.0, 1449.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 妻的感动\n\n作者：员工家属/张宁桥\n\n妻钱淑琴，现在胖东来生活广场三楼百货区工作，每当妻说起自己的昨天与今天，都会潸然泪下。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_603_224_728.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n妻原来的工作单位由于经营不好，于2000年破产了。接到失业下岗通知的那一刻，妻哭了，毕竟从此要离开自己工作十多年的岗位了。妻说：“我该怎么办？”看着妻黯然神伤的表情，我极力安慰她。很长一段时间里，妻一直无法从下岗的阴影中走出来，一直感觉很茫然，很苦闷。以后在家的日子里，妻一直在努力，希望能重新找到工作，但终因年龄、技能等诸多原因而被拒之门外。妻闷闷不乐的心情，影响了我们已快8岁的女儿，我希望能早日有个转折，打破这种沉重的气氛，重新找回昔日欢乐的家庭。\n\n2002年7月初，妻经人介绍在胖东来公司填了招工表格。在等待面试的时间里，妻一直在问我：\n\n“能行吗？”看得出此时妻的心情很忐忑，可以\n\n看得出此次面试的通过对妻的重要性。\n\n妻从面试的房间出来，快步跑到我的面前，\n\n紧紧地抓住我的手，言语中透着无比的喜悦：“你\n\n知道吗，我被通过了！”泪水随即夺眶而出。\n\n\n\n\n\n以后开始了严格的军训。7月夏天，骄阳似火，看着妻被晒得黝黑的皮肤，看着妻被汗水打湿的发际，我关心地问：“苦吗？累吗？”“不苦，不累！”妻坚定地说，“我坚信军训会培养我严格认真的工作作风和吃苦耐劳的毅力。你知道吗，今天公司领导冒着酷暑来看望我们了，并送来了许多的防暑物品。”\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_680_641_1010_1050.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"27%\" /></div>\n\n\n随后的时间里，妻进入了严格的实习阶段：先后经历了电器量贩的搬迁、服饰鞋业大楼的装修、配送中心物品的搬运等工作，始终没有听到妻说一声苦。\n\n2002年9月9日，妻被正式分配到胖东来生活广场三楼工作，这天清早，妻穿着崭新的工装，静静地站在镜子前，许久，妻哭了……", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_603_224_728.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//141bc82e-f376-4958-8cc5-b7531af69323/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_73_603_224_728.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A00%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2Fdaf490c60cc6791e873d195ce5987cab3336261137e2338d3e4faf4d0e184bcb", "imgs/img_in_image_box_680_641_1010_1050.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//141bc82e-f376-4958-8cc5-b7531af69323/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_680_641_1010_1050.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A00%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2F8bfcc11ae4dcd2b6a95f309b32a9cd18b30203c46f9a33432eb1d317876ff6ea"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//141bc82e-f376-4958-8cc5-b7531af69323/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A00%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2F1fe1704eff07b86f6097304bec6ab588ca67c1470385cac3eba013c50770cdb2"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//141bc82e-f376-4958-8cc5-b7531af69323/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A00%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2F1fa5f23d5df335945ecf9adaa5e0518cf042f416a66a41ed4806491285c737e2"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//141bc82e-f376-4958-8cc5-b7531af69323/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A00%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2F1afed9b6beeea929d71824a4fd41b38b445e461df3cfcbdc7be1dda2991cc042"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
